   "gap": "On the current route the existence construction (annex:p15.conditional-existence, lines 31-39) applies Radon-Nikodym on (Omega,G) with reference measure P restricted to G and then writes the densities' event integrals and total integrals against P (int_A Z dP = nu_+(A) - nu_-(A)) without a written step identifying integrals of G-measurable functions against P|G with integrals against P. The owner packet w02c-p15-007 supplies that step and the full construction against P (thm:p15-w02c-p15-007-restricted-integral and thm:p15-w02c-p15-007-density-version, with written proofs) plus a worked boundary (two-cell example; failure of sigma-finiteness under restriction), but those files are not yet input on the route.",
